DATA ATTRIBUTION & PUBLIC DOMAIN NOTICE (CC0-1.0)

All experimental combustion run tables, investigation metadata, and research
reports distributed in `data/curated/` originate from the NASA Physical
Sciences Informatics (PSI) repository (https://psi.nasa.gov) and the NASA
Technical Reports Server (https://ntrs.nasa.gov), released under Creative
Commons Zero (CC0-1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication). Please cite each
NASA PSI investigation by its official DOI as listed in `README.md` and
`data/curated/investigations.csv`.
